Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:24:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 265/270] HDMI: preferences for the Tegra 2 HDMI output

Shows the screen plugged into the HDMI port and the mode it gets, and
sets the resolution choice (automatic, the screen's preferred mode or
1280x720), plain DVI and a stronger signal. The choices go into the
tegra_dc driver settings and apply at once. Part of the ARM image.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
